1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,740
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 17=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(That wretch is dragging me into this!)

4
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,760
Your Majesty!

5
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,280
Please, see me!

6
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,040
I've been framed.

7
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,200
Your Majesty!

8
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,240
Please, I'm begging you.

9
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,520
(Imperial Study)

10
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,360
Zhaoyi Rong.

11
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,960
Why put yourself through this?

12
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,120
Please go back.

13
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,280
His Majesty said

14
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,640
he won't see you.

15
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,520
Eunuch Liu.

16
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,920
Please tell His Majesty one more time.

17
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:52,040
I must explain something to him
in person.

18
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,800
I really am innocent.

19
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,560
(Imperial Study)

20
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,480
Zhaoyi Rong.

21
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,240
Don't make this hard for me.

22
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,600
Please go back.

23
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,520
Your Highness!

24
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,760
Your Highness!

25
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:17,880
Your Highness!

26
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,320
Physician!

27
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,560
Get a physician!

28
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:30,720
Your Highness.

29
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,840
I just heard that

30
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,880
Consort Rong ruined
Concubine Rou's face.

31
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,640
His Majesty was furious.

32
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,320
She's been demoted to Zhaoyi.

33
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:45,320
His Majesty still has a soft spot
for her.

34
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,960
Otherwise, for poisoning a consort

35
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,240
and ruining his beloved
Concubine Rou's face,

36
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,720
such a grave offense...

37
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,920
She'd be put to death,

38
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,840
or at least thrown into the cold palace.

39
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,840
Indeed.

40
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,520
The punishment is light enough.

41
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,840
I wonder if Fu Rong

42
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,520
will make it through this.

43
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,720
Concubine Rou,

44
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,280
what is this?

45
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,080
Your Highness.

46
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,640
I have a favor to ask.

47
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,160
Get up.

48
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,920
Have a seat and tell me.

49
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,080
Look, Your Highness.

50
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,480
How did it get this bad?

51
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:43,120
As you can see,

52
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:44,360
Fu Rong

53
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,600
envies the favor His Majesty
bestows on me.

54
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,760
She poisoned my pearl powder

55
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,960
and ruined my face.

56
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,240
Director Zhang says

57
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,840
even if it heals,

58
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,920
it may still leave scars.

59
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,480
I never imagined

60
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Zhaoyi Rong could be so ruthless.

61
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,560
So...

62
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,440
What's your plan?

63
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:08,040
She ruined my face.

64
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,480
I want her dead.

65
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,320
But His Majesty only demoted her.

66
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,600
He didn't have her executed.

67
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,960
I can't accept that.

68
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,880
Fu Rong

69
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,600
is cunning and calculating.

70
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,320
If she ever

71
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,160
finds a chance to climb back up,

72
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,480
she'll be much harder

73
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,520
to deal with.

74
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,880
So...

75
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:33,000
What are you saying?

76
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:33,960
Your Highness.

77
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:36,360
Fu Rong is very dangerous.

78
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:38,400
First she dares harm me,

79
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:41,400
next she may come after you!

80
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:44,400
If we don't root her out now,

81
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,080
once she regains her footing,

82
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:48,680
she'll become your greatest threat.

83
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,200
That's why

84
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,600
I came to you today.

85
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,640
I'm begging you

86
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,360
to help me.

87
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,600
Your Highness.

88
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,640
Think about it.

89
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,840
With Fu Rong gone,

90
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:04,080
who in the harem

91
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,960
could ever rival you?

92
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:07,840
I'll do the dirty work

93
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,480
and remove your greatest rival.

94
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:10,640
Once and for all.

95
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,880
Isn't that perfect?

96
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,080
Your Highness.

97
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:18,240
I would never show you any disrespect.

98
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,160
Once Fu Rong is gone,

99
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,160
I'll

100
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,720
follow your lead in everything.

101
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,320
I swear my loyalty.

102
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,360
You...

103
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,120
I have no taste for such schemes.

104
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,360
Let me think about it.

105
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,160
Your Highness.

106
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,960
Please help me.

107
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,000
My face means everything to me.

108
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,800
That wretch ruined it.

109
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,320
I just can't let this go,
Your Highness!

110
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,480
Fu Rong

111
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,840
really shouldn't have
treated you so viciously.

112
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,080
Exactly, Your Highness.

113
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,760
The entire harem

114
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:57,040
knows I'm on your side.

115
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,720
If we let this go,

116
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,160
what will the other consorts

117
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,920
think of me?

118
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,840
Who will respect your authority

119
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,280
over the harem then?

120
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,800
You're impossible.

121
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,400
Tell me.

122
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,640
How do you want me to help?

123
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,720
Your Highness.

124
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,680
I need just one thing.

125
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,480
Red alum.

126
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,840
Red alum?

127
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,440
Yes.

128
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,400
Fu Rong caught a chill
in the rain yesterday.

129
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:32,280
The Imperial Hospital will surely
give her cassia twig decoction.

130
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,600
I've heard

131
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,760
red alum clashes with cassia twig.

132
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,120
If it's mixed into her medicine

133
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,440
and she drinks it,

134
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,280
she'll die for sure.

135
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,760
But red alum is quite common.

136
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,120
It's used to repel insects
and prevent dampness.

137
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,080
Nothing rare about it.

138
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:51,640
True.

139
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:55,200
The Imperial Household
uses it for pest control.

140
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:58,080
But old red alum, left too long,

141
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,920
loses strength once it gets damp.

142
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:01,960
I was thinking...

143
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,400
Since you oversee the harem,

144
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,400
could you order the Imperial Household
to do pest control?

145
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,640
Once they do,

146
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:13,120
I'll have a chance to get fresh red alum.

147
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,120
Fine.

148
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,560
For the sake of your loyalty,

149
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,400
and since she ruined your face,

150
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,320
which is truly infuriating,

151
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,480
I feel for you too.

152
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:27,960
Citing the warmer weather

153
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:29,160
and rising insects,

154
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,520
I'll order the Imperial Household
to fumigate every palace.

155
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,080
Thank you, Your Highness.

156
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,680
Concubine Rou's face is ruined,

157
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,360
and you've been demoted to Zhaoyi.

158
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,520
Why put yourself through this?

159
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,560
Physician Li.

160
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,520
Please treat Her Highness at once.

161
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,600
At a time like this,

162
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,160
what good is scolding her?

163
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,080
Chunli.

164
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,240
Don't be so rude to Physician Li.

165
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,080
Though the cold has entered deep,

166
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,600
it hasn't turned to heat yet.

167
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,120
Physician Wang came earlier

168
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,520
and prescribed cassia twig decoction.

169
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:42,720
I'll write another prescription

170
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,880
with a few herbs to balance it.

171
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,320
Take the medicine on time

172
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,200
and rest well.

173
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,280
You'll recover within seven days.

174
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:55,840
Chunli.

175
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,120
Come get the medicine with me.

176
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,400
Yes.

177
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:10,660
(Imperial Hospital)

178
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,120
Where'd that cat come from?

179
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,680
Don't knock over
Her Highness's medicine.

180
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,200
Time for your medicine.

181
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,160
Your Highness!

182
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,720
Your Highness, what's wrong?

183
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,640
Physician!

184
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,520
Your Highness...

185
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:08,460
(Zhongning Palace)

186
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,040
Your Highness.

187
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,520
News from Jinghe Palace.

188
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,400
Zhaoyi Rong has been poisoned.

189
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,560
She spat blood on the spot.

190
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:26,920
Several physicians came
but couldn't help.

191
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:27,920
I heard

192
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,160
His Majesty just went there.

193
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,760
Then I should go as well.

194
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,560
Zhaoyi Rong only got caught in the rain.

195
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,960
How could her life be in danger now?

196
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:45,800
Your Majesty.

197
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,320
Zhaoyi Rong has been severely poisoned.

198
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,080
It's spreading fast

199
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:48,960
and has reached her heart.

200
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,800
Her life is in danger.

201
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,720
I've used silver needles
to protect her heart meridian,

202
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,600
but Zhaoyi Rong

203
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,320
may still not survive, Your Majesty.

204
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,520
Poisoned? Again?

205
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,040
How could she be hurt so badly?

206
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,320
Physician Li.

207
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,600
Here are the dregs of
her medicine from today.

208
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,760
I brought them all.

209
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,680
Please take a look.

210
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,080
Red alum?

211
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,720
Someone put red alum in her medicine.

212
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,720
Red alum?

213
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,480
Your Majesty.

214
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,520
Red alum is intensely hot.

215
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:24,320
Taken with cassia twig decoction
for chills,

216
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,560
their properties clash.

217
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,760
Once swallowed,

218
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,880
it burns the organs

219
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:28,680
and causes vomiting of blood.

220
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:29,720
With a larger dose,

221
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,040
it can kill within an hour.

222
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,520
Who would dare do such a thing?

223
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:37,160
Poisoning consorts in the harem
time and again!

224
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,840
Your Majesty.

225
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,840
I brewed the medicine myself today,

226
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:41,720
never leaving it.

227
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,280
I didn't slack for a moment.

228
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,160
Investigate.

229
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,560
Find out

230
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,880
who went to the Imperial Pharmacy today.

231
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,920
Yes.

232
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:49,680
Your Majesty.

233
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,320
Servants are constantly

234
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,880
going in and out of the brewing area.

235
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,560
But of those who went today,

236
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,080
one person is highly suspicious.

237
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,680
That person is...

238
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Concubine Rou.

239
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,520
Concubine Rou?

240
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,160
How foolish.

241
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,480
Summon Concubine Rou!

242
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:13,560
Yes.

243
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,560
Your Majesty summoned me here.

244
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,680
May I ask what this is about?

245
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,440
Concubine Rou.

246
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,600
I know

247
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,560
you resent having your face ruined.

248
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,200
But I already punished Zhaoyi Rong.

249
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:39,120
Why did you still poison her
and take her life?

250
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,360
I was wrong.

251
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,640
I only wanted to vent my anger.

252
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:48,440
I never meant to kill Zhaoyi Rong.

253
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:50,560
You couldn't be more foolish.

254
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:51,680
Guards.

255
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,320
Take Concubine Rou to
​​the Office of Punishment​.

256
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,040
I'll find out exactly

257
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:57,440
how you tampered with
Zhaoyi Rong's medicine!

258
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,040
No need.

259
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,880
I confess.

260
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,160
It was me.

261
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,600
I put red alum in
Zhaoyi Rong's medicine.

262
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,200
You say it so lightly,

263
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:11,920
with no remorse at all!

264
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:26,920
Your Majesty.

265
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,520
Something's wrong with this powder.

266
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:30,920
Your Majesty may not know,

267
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,320
the red alum the Imperial Household
gives out

268
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,840
is overseen by the Imperial Hospital.

269
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,400
But the weather just turned warm.

270
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,280
There are few insects.

271
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,720
We haven't given out
new red alum this year.

272
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:40,320
They're using last year's old stock.

273
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:41,960
Look, Your Majesty.

274
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,600
The remaining red alum powder

275
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,600
is bright in color,

276
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:45,400
with even grains.

277
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,720
Its scent also lingers.

278
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,120
This is clearly new.

279
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:50,280
The palace hasn't made
such potent red alum.

280
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,720
The paper wrapped around it

281
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:53,720
is brocade paper,

282
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,880
a tribute from Jiangnan.

283
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,240
As far as I know,

284
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,080
this paper

285
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,640
is allotted in limited quantities
each month.

286
00:13:59,040 --> 00:13:59,920
It's reserved solely

287
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:02,320
for Consort Qi to copy scriptures.

288
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:04,040
No one else in the palace uses it.

289
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,360
Your Majesty.

290
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,720
I don't know why this happened!

291
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,760
Your Highness.

292
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,200
Now that things have come to this,

293
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,680
I can't cover for you anymore.

294
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:17,360
Your Majesty.

295
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:18,760
It was Consort Qi.

296
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,440
She gave me this packet of red alum

297
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,920
and ordered me

298
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,120
to poison Zhaoyi Rong's medicine.

299
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,360
(That wretch.)

300
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,120
(She deceived me)

301
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,640
(and dragged me into this!)

302
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:37,980
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

303
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:43,020
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

304
00:14:43,140 --> 00:14:47,820
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

305
00:14:48,020 --> 00:14:52,660
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

306
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:57,420
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

307
00:14:57,820 --> 00:15:02,460
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

308
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:07,260
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

309
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:12,220
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

310
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:15,020
♪Let the stars and sea♪

311
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:17,020
♪Wait for your return♪
(Changsheng Gate)

312
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:21,400
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

313
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:25,700
♪Let the stars and sea
